# Optional: point the live demo at a deployed FastAPI backend.
#   - Leave unset  -> tries same-origin /api, then falls back to the
#     in-browser detector (works on a pure static deploy).
#   - Set a URL    -> uses that backend; falls back locally if it's down.
# Copy to .env.production and fill in, or set VITE_API_BASE in the host UI.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-backend.onrender.com
